# Does the original need Shift to hold on to a ledge?
#
# Level 1's middle row is open above at columns 0..2 and floored from column
# 3, so a Prince standing at column 2 facing right has empty above him and a
# ledge above and in front. Careful steps are used to get there because they
# do not drift: one press gives one step however long the key is held, so the
# emulator's speed cannot carry him further than the port.
#
# Then Up is held on its own, and only afterwards Up with Shift. If the
# original ends up on the floor above during the first of those, Up alone is
# enough to hang and climb; if it only gets up there during the second, the
# grip needs Shift. The port currently needs Shift.
level 1
cycles 400
settle 40
phase - 3
phase rs 3
phase - 2
phase rs 3
phase - 2
phase rs 3
phase - 3
phase u 10
phase - 3
phase us 10
phase s 3
phase us 6
phase - 3
